      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know. Nobody else seems to be using it for that in Rust, except for a test.\n\nLooking at `adb shell service list`, the only service named the same as its interface is android.service.gatekeeper.IGateKeeperService. The rest are a match of single words (e.g. connectivity), CamelCase (e.g. SurfaceFlinger), snake_case (e.g. bluetooth_manager, sec_key_att_app_id_provider), dot separated which may or may not match their package name (e.g. media.camera.proxy, android.security.identity), or even a mix of several (drm.drmManager, media.resource_manager).",
